    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Password Visibility\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n\r\n\r\n1. Add `let showPassword = false;` at the top of your JS.\r\n1. Write a `render()` function that:\r\n\r\n   * Sets the input field’s `type` to `\"text\"` when `showPassword` is true.\r\n   * Sets it to `\"password\"` when `showPassword` is false.\r\n1. In the checkbox change event: flip `showPassword` and call `render()`.\r\n\r\n",
